A box-and-whisker plot of the daily rainfall (in mm) at a station in Murree has these features:
• the median is 30;
• the interquartile range is 18;
• the distance from the median to the upper quartile is twice the distance from the lower quartile to the median;
• the upper whisker is twice as long as the lower whisker;
• the range is 54.
There are no outliers marked.
